# docs/: markdown documentation is tracked; everything else under docs/ (screenshots, journey JSON,
# logs, TAP output, run folders) is generated evidence and stays local. Evidence that must be kept in
# git is added explicitly with `git add -f`, as the existing audit artifacts were.
